  intro i hi hc
  rcases (show i < 7 ∨ (7 ≤ i ∧ i < 14) ∨ (14 ≤ i ∧ i < 21) ∨ (21 ≤ i ∧ i < 28) ∨ (28 ≤ i ∧ i < 35) ∨ (35 ≤ i ∧ i < 101) ∨ (101 ≤ i ∧ i < 114) ∨ (114 ≤ i ∧ i < 122) ∨ (122 ≤ i ∧ i < 129) ∨ (129 ≤ i ∧ i < 136) ∨ (136 ≤ i ∧ i < 143) ∨ (143 ≤ i ∧ i < 150) ∨ (150 ≤ i ∧ i < 157) ∨ (157 ≤ i ∧ i < 164) ∨ 164 ≤ i by omega) with h | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | h1
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor06_00
      (tailExclCaps06 heps) (Nat.zero_le _) h hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor06_01
      (tailExclCaps06 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor06_02
      (tailExclCaps06 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor06_03
